  "details": "I will be teleported into a portal even when one isn’t logically near me.\nFor example: The midnight rooftop has a portal under the downstairs stairs. Previously, I would walk down the stairs and not get teleported. Now when I walk down the stairs (and the portal is under me, not visually near me) it teleports me.\nOr, another example: In the beat saber world, there are portals off to the side of the map. There are also pens near the side of the map. When I’m not in beta and I got to reach for a pen, it doesn’t teleport me. When I’m in beta, it teleports me before I can get close to the pens.",
